[size=5][b][color=#ef6a5a]AI disclosure[/color][/b][/size]
Parts of this mod were produced with AI assistance. In the interest of transparency:
[list]
[*][b]Code, XML configuration and the 13 translations[/b]: written with the help of Anthropic's Claude and reviewed before release.
[*][b]The activation sound[/b]: generated with the ElevenLabs sound-effect generator.
[*][b]The drone model and its texture are NOT AI-generated[/b] - they are a commercial asset bought from a human artist (see Credits). Its licence also forbids using it to train or fine-tune AI models, and nothing here does.
[/list]
The design, the testing and the final decisions are the author's.

[size=5][b][color=#ef6a5a]Source[/color][/b][/size]
Full source - Harmony DLL, XML, Unity build script, release workflow - on [url=https://github.com/HannaPanda/7D2D-Agent-Armory][b]GitHub[/b][/url], MIT licensed.

[b]The drone art and the sound are not covered by that MIT licence[/b] - they are licensed to me, not re-licensable onward. Fork the mod freely; bring your own model, material and icon.
